-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids May to June and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 188% of normal in May to June, then fell to 47% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle sat at 48% of normal in February to March. Grid 16666 had its driest year in 1952 at 63%.</p>"}
